Description: rename the Hub distribution identity to pstack-azhouzhou
Author: Azhou AI Hub
Forwarded: not-needed

Upstream ships the plugin under the name pstack. This Hub distributes
the same skills under its own identity so every harness registry can
tell the Hub build from the upstream one. Only the distribution name
and the keyword list change. Authorship, version, and every skill stay
upstream's, and a re-import of pristine upstream reapplies this patch
through the queue.

--- a/pstack/plugin.json
+++ b/pstack/plugin.json
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 {
   "$schema": "https://agent-plugins.org/schemas/1.0.0/plugin.schema.json",
-  "name": "pstack",
+  "name": "pstack-azhouzhou",
   "version": "0.15.36",
   "description": "if you want to go fast, go deep first. pstack helps you write less, but higher quality code. rigorous agent workflows you can parallelize with confidence.",
   "author": {
@@ -10,12 +10,13 @@
   "repository": "https://github.com/cursor/plugins",
   "license": "MIT",
   "keywords": [
-    "pstack",
+    "pstack-azhouzhou",
     "poteto-mode",
     "workflow",
     "principles",
     "agent-style",
     "subagents",
-    "unslop"
+    "unslop",
+    "azhouzhou"
   ]
 }
